# Bone-Cairn Butcher: "Attacking tokens you control have deathtouch." On turn 3 the Butcher and an Ornithopter attack and
# the Butcher mobilizes two Warrior tokens: the attacking tokens have deathtouch, the attacking Ornithopter (not a token)
# keeps only flying, and the Butcher itself has none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Plains
Bone-Cairn Butcher
Ornithopter
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bone-Cairn Butcher.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Bone-Cairn Butcher > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Warrior Token#1.Keywords = Deathtouch
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 8
